# A square pyramid, for testing the OBJ loader.
#
# Deliberately written with a quad base (exercising fan triangulation) and with no
# vn directives (exercising winding-derived normals). Coordinates are in a unit
# cube so it can be scaled by its transform like the primitives.
o pyramid
v -1.0  0.0 -1.0
v  1.0  0.0 -1.0
v  1.0  0.0  1.0
v -1.0  0.0  1.0
v  0.0  1.5  0.0
# Base, wound so its normal points down.
f 1 2 3 4
# Four sides, wound counter-clockwise seen from outside.
f 1 5 2
f 2 5 3
f 3 5 4
f 4 5 1
